    "created_at": "2026-05-04T16:27:21Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-05-04T16:27:21Z",
    "body": "> UA Shadow roots are an implementation detail and shouldn't be by default exposed.\n\nI agree with this, but the interpretation of this statement in the context of this issue is a bit murky. I'd say the OP exposes a mechanism through which a UA shadow can be detected, by looking at the difference between `:focus` and `:focus-within`.\n\n> > your jsbin demo does not work (some intermediary error).\n> \n> Yeah, Jsbin's certificate unfortunately expired. I'm hoping they get it renewed soon.\n\nBTW, they got their certificate renewed, so the OP's repro link now works again.",
