    "updated_at": "2026-05-11T11:53:15Z",
    "body": "For that demo I think the behavior in Firefox generally makes sense to me, except I'm not sure why `:focus-visible` should no longer match the outer element when we're inside the shadow tree. Though also the date & time picker icons behave weirdly in Firefox. Not sure why they cause the host to no longer match `:focus`.",
